ys with Kazuma in an online game, but neither of them knows their true name until it is revealed during her route."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Her being mentioned / guest appearance in PRIMAL×HEARTS 2 will only happen if you have entered Mashiro / Alicetia's route. She will be the lover of Kazuma in Mashiro’s route."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20423"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/79/79d7e2301418873b19e410f58eb17f0d4efc05b89ef26d064ab235776310e40d.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ff/ffd64320beb37fc2c49828c6153dba763de5aa1c75651e5418f80246afe53bdf.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"遥 そら","creatorId":"vndb:s195","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s195","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s195","name":"仙台 エリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:88991","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c20427","characterName":"帯刀 和馬","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c20427"},"originalCharacterName":"帯刀 和馬","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The protagonist. Because of various circumstances, he transferred to Ainoshima Gakuen during May. He wants to use this opportunity to get a pretty girlfriend."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It was revealed his original name:"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"\"Narukami Kazuma(鳴神和馬)\""}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c20427"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b2/b25293f80f9d73f5c9034dbb45554312d0d0b70a1812198b609b52cab2252786.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bisho